#ASSERT `By when must my court assessment be completed` TRUE (`d` 1 11 2026) (`d` 30 11 2026) EQUALS `d` 7 12 2026

§§ `Temporary treatment orders`

#ASSERT `Can a temporary treatment order be made on me` `an assessment order` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `a community or an inpatient temporary treatment order may be made`
